WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.741
Any document can become something you listen to.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:11.403
Open a PDF, an e-book, or a Word file, and TTSNative reads it aloud.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:17.156
Follow along, sentence by sentence, and pick up right where you left off.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:24.615
Choose from fifty-four natural voices, and export to MP3.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:30.983
Want your own voice? Record a short sample, give consent, and it reads for you.

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:36.684
Everything runs on your computer. No accounts, and no cloud.

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:44.264
TTSNative. Free and open source. And yes, it made this voice-over.
